slides.prompt:
A cinematic and high-fidelity title slide that sets a tone of technological supremacy. A deep navy background is split by a vibrant orange-red gradient block on the right, which houses a custom-clipped image of a futuristic cityscape. The typography is massive and bold, utilizing high-contrast colors to communicate authority and innovation. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "HorizontalSplit",
    "ratio": "40/60",
    "padding": "48px"
  },
  "branding": {
    "logo_icon": "diamond",
    "logo_color": "#F97316",
    "company": "INNOVATE SOLUTIONS"
  },
  "background": { "color": "#0F1528" },
  "typography": {
    "h1_a": { "text": "INNOVATE", "color": "#F97316", "size": "72px", "weight": "900" },
    "h1_b": { "text": "SOLUTIONS", "color": "#FFFFFF", "size": "72px", "weight": "900" },
    "tagline": { "text": "Sustainable Digital Transformation", "color": "#94A3B8", "spacing": "0.2em" }
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "gradient_block": { "from": "#E11D48", "to": "#F97316", "clip": "polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%)" },
    "image_mask": { "clip": "polygon(25% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 25% 100%, 0 45%)", "image": "futuristic_city_sunset" },
    "accents": [
      { "shape": "dot_grid", "pos": "top-left", "opacity": "0.3" },
      { "shape": "glowing_circle", "color": "#F97316", "pos": "bottom-center" }
    ]
  }
}

A high-impact engineering slide that emphasizes technical precision and environmental care. A massive, diagonally-clipped image of high-tech machinery dominates the left side, while the right side provides a clean, vertical narrative space. A vibrant gradient action button at the bottom serves as a focal point for engagement. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DiagonalSplit",
  "colors": { "bg": "#0F1528", "accent": "#E11D48" },
  "visuals": {
    "left_image": { "clip": "polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%)", "image": "high_precision_engineering" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "size": "36px", "weight": "900", "color": "#FFFFFF" },
    "body": { "size": "14px", "color": "#94A3B8", "line_height": "1.8" }
  },
  "components": {
    "cta_button": { "text": "Technical Specs", "bg": "linear-gradient(to right, #F97316, #E11D48)" }
  }
}

A sophisticated layout that simplifies complex strategic concepts through visual elegance. Multiple overlapping hexagonal image layers create a sense of depth and technical complexity, while a glowing central icon represents the simplification of legacy systems through strategic oversight. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "LayeredHexagons",
  "background": { "color": "#0F1528", "accent": "#F97316_glow" },
  "visuals": {
    "hex_layers": 3,
    "icon": "cpu",
    "icon_color": "#F97316"
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": "Bold 32px #FFFFFF",
    "body": "Regular 13px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A bespoke highlight slide that features a large, centered card as the visual anchor. The card is split into a high-definition image of cloud hardware and a detailed set of technical bullet points, all framed by a professional ribbon header that adds a layer of corporate branding. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CenteredHighlightCard",
  "card": {
    "bg": "#FFFFFF",
    "split": "50/50",
    "radius": "24px"
  },
  "typography": {
    "card_title": "Black 24px #0F1528",
    "card_body": "Medium 12px #475569"
  },
  "icons": ["cloud", "shield"]
}

A balanced comparison slide that grounds technological discussion in human talent. Large, colorful icon containers on the left present key partner benefits, while a diagonally-clipped photograph of a high-energy team on the right emphasizes collaborative success and shared growth. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DualColumnBalanced",
  "background": "#0F1528",
  "components": [
    { "type": "icon_card", "icon": "zap", "bg": "#F97316" },
    { "type": "icon_card", "icon": "target", "bg": "#E11D48" }
  ],
  "visuals": {
    "right_image": { "clip": "diagonal", "image": "energetic_collaborative_team" }
  }
}

A high-fidelity grid of leadership portraits clipped into sophisticated hexagonal masks. Each headshot is framed by a subtle glowing border, with refined typography beneath that communicates stability, vision, and depth of experience across the executive team. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "4HexGrid",
  "hex": { "size": "180px", "glow": "#F97316" },
  "typography": {
    "name": "Black 18px #FFFFFF",
    "role": "Uppercase 10px #F97316"
  }
}

An infographic-driven roadmap slide featuring a large, segmented donut chart as the central focus. Each segment represents a key development phase, supported by corresponding text columns at the bottom that provide a deep-dive journey from research to global scale. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "InfographicDonut",
  "chart": { "segments": 4, "colors": ["#F97316", "#E11D48", "#F43F5E", "#FB923C"] },
  "typography": {
    "label": "Bold 14px #FFFFFF",
    "desc": "Medium 11px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A high-impact hero slide featuring a full-bleed image of a sun-lit solar facility. A heavy orange-to-red gradient overlay adds mood and brand consistency, while a clean white container at the bottom provides a sharp space for high-fidelity metrics and calls to action. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "FullBleedHero",
  "visuals": {
    "bg_image": "solar_facility_sunset",
    "overlay": "linear-gradient(rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.7), rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.7))"
  },
  "components": {
    "bottom_strip": { "bg": "#FFFFFF", "icons": ["sun", "leaf"] }
  }
}

A data-driven dashboard designed for fiscal transparency. A dark, professional sidebar on the left provides context, while the main area is dominated by a large, high-contrast bar chart that communicates bottom-line results and the success of resource optimization. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "VerticalSidebarDashboard",
  "sidebar": { "width": "120px", "bg": "#0F1528_pattern" },
  "chart": { "type": "Bar", "color": "#F97316" },
  "metrics": { "highlight": "30%", "label": "Efficiency Increase" }
}
